{"schema_version":1,"batch_id":"screening-0065","screening_model":"gpt-5.6-luna","reasoning":"medium","prompt_version":"gauss-screening-v1","item_count":25,"subject":"math","topic_key":"exponential_logarithmic","total_weight":31,"expected_output":"screening-0065.output.jsonl","items":[{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_1492","source_sha256":"b0a4aa188a303387398336fa75936a8cc92cc72ed81e6cdc483ea5edd79e292b","subject":"math","section_id":"math_functions_equations","source_topic_key":"exponential_logarithmic","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"نمودار تابع $f(x)=|(\\fracrac12)^{x+a}+b|$ به شکل زیر است. $a-b$ کدام است؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1492/stem_1.webp","alt":"نمودار قدرمطلق نمایی با راس در مبدا و مجانب $y=2$","aspect_ratio":1.2799}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$1$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$-1$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$3$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$-3$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"تابع $y = (\\frac{1}{2})^{x+a} + b$ اکیداً نزولی است که در $+\\infty$ به سمت $b$ میل می‌کند. با توجه به نمودار $f(x)$ مشخص است که $b = -2$ است. هم‌چنین نمودار از مبدأ مختصات می‌گذرد یعنی $f(0) = 0$.\n$f(0) = 0 \\Rightarrow (\\frac{1}{2})^{0+a} - 2 = 0 \\Rightarrow (\\frac{1}{2})^a = 2 \\Rightarrow a = -1$\n$\\Rightarrow a - b = -1 - (-2) = 1$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1492/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1492/stem_1.webp","sha256":"8efa48005ea722a0e7d9b4a7f34b71b8fcdb2c55acdd2aa186b847a1670e3638","bytes":3628}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":1492,"question_pdf":"12.pdf","question_page":7,"solution_page":139,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_1493","source_sha256":"1749cf20f99e3fe7c774fe218e15bdfe06aacd2b5e96452ec7598b11f425663a","subject":"math","section_id":"math_functions_equations","source_topic_key":"exponential_logarithmic","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"نمودار تابع $f(x)=a-3^{-x+b}$ به صورت زیر است. $f(-1)$ کدام است؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1493/stem_1.webp","alt":"نمودار افزایشی با مجانب افقی $y=3$ و عبور از مبدا","aspect_ratio":1.2338}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$-1$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$-3$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$-6$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$-9$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"با توجه به نمودار، تابع $f(x)$ در $+\\infty$ به سمت $3$ میل می‌کند. بنابراین $a = 3$ است. هم‌چنین تابع از مبدأ مختصات می‌گذرد، در نتیجه $f(0) = 0$ می‌باشد.\n$f(x) = 3 - 3^{-x+b} \\xrightarrow{f(0)=0} 3 - 3^b = 0 \\Rightarrow b = 1$\n$\\Rightarrow f(x) = 3 - 3^{-x+1} \\Rightarrow f(-1) = 3 - 3^2 = -6$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1493/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1493/stem_1.webp","sha256":"8cb1a7dadd3cb3d96ad4954850f2c256899fb9c1f1d9f56745fe5ae000ed3e48","bytes":6138}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":1493,"question_pdf":"12.pdf","question_page":7,"solution_page":139,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_1494","source_sha256":"4f3db298faaebbc115cd0b6de62183803b36d799619668c0a7bfbb3e89515501","subject":"math","section_id":"math_functions_equations","source_topic_key":"exponential_logarithmic","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"با فرض $\\log5=0/7$، حاصل $\\log16$ کدام است؟"}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$1/2$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$1/4$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$1/6$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$1/8$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"می‌دانیم:\n$\\log 5 = 1 - \\log 2 = 0/7$\nدر نتیجه: $\\log 2 = 0/3$\n$\\log 16 = \\log 2^4 = 4 \\log 2 = 4 \\times 0/3 = 1/2$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":[],"media_evidence":[],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":1494,"question_pdf":"12.pdf","question_page":7,"solution_page":139,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_1495","source_sha256":"3bc3eb353c4317aa457bfac85227a4a00d68a9f163e4af573f6c03fe9e6ec5ea","subject":"math","section_id":"math_functions_equations","source_topic_key":"exponential_logarithmic","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"اگر $A=\\log_3 0/75$ باشد، حاصل لگاریتم $9^{1-A}$ در پایه $4$ کدام است؟"}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$1$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$2$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$3$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$4$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"ابتدا مقدار $9^{1-A}$ را به دست می‌آوریم:\n$9^{1-A} = 9^{1 - \\log_3 0/75} = 9^{1 - \\log_3 \\frac{3}{4}} = 9^{\\log_3 3 - \\log_3 \\frac{3}{4}}$\n$= 9^{\\log_3 4} = 3^{2 \\log_3 4} = 3^{\\log_3 16} = 16$\nاکنون، لگاریتم $9^{1-A}$ را در پایه ۴ محاسبه می‌کنیم:\n$\\log_4 9^{1-A} = \\log_4 16 = 2$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":[],"media_evidence":[],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":1495,"question_pdf":"12.pdf","question_page":7,"solution_page":139,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_1496","source_sha256":"a8f1984a4d91502c0d3306bc42cfa3994db42c4f597f5b4d3304e1867b41b3c0","subject":"math","section_id":"math_functions_equations","source_topic_key":"exponential_logarithmic","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"اگر لگاریتم عدد $\\sqrt[4]{0/125}$ در مبنای $8$ برابر $k$ باشد، لگاریتم عدد $2-\\fracrac1k$ در پایه $8$ کدام است؟"}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$\\fracrac12$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$2$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\fracrac23$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\fracrac32$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"ابتدا مقدار $k$ را به دست می‌آوریم:\n$k = \\log_8 4\\sqrt{0/125} = \\log_8 4\\sqrt{\\frac{1}{8}} = \\log_{2^3} 2^2 \\times 2^{-\\frac{3}{2}}$\n$= \\log_{2^3} 2^{\\frac{1}{2}} = \\frac{\\frac{1}{2}}{3} \\log_2 2 = \\frac{1}{6}$\nحال مقدار $\\log_8 (\\frac{1}{k} - 2)$ را محاسبه می‌کنیم:\n$\\log_8 (\\frac{1}{\\frac{1}{6}} - 2) = \\log_8 (6 - 2) = \\log_{2^3} 2^2 = \\frac{2}{3} \\log_2 2 = \\frac{2}{3}$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":[],"media_evidence":[],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":1496,"question_pdf":"12.pdf","question_page":7,"solution_page":139,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_1497","source_sha256":"50162350dc60b01ab474d7e60d3e495949494380b1207bd14d4be1926f0362eb","subject":"math","section_id":"math_functions_equations","source_topic_key":"exponential_logarithmic","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"اگر $\\log5=k$ باشد، ساده‌شده $3\\log_5 20-\\log_5 8$ کدام است؟"}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$3k$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\fracrac3k$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$k+3$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$3k-1$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"ابتدا $\\log_5 8$ را به صورت $3 \\log_5 2$ می‌نویسیم.\n$3 \\log_5 20 - \\log_5 8 = 3 \\log_5 20 - 3 \\log_5 2$\n$= 3 (\\log_5 20 - \\log_5 2) = 3 (\\log_5 \\frac{20}{2}) = 3 \\log_5 10$\n$= \\frac{3}{\\log_{10} 5} = \\frac{3}{\\log 5} = \\frac{3}{k}$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":[],"media_evidence":[],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":1497,"question_pdf":"12.pdf","question_page":7,"solution_page":139,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_1498","source_sha256":"da3d079f6b05a2d828149911ab2c5336ad9b0edcc080f312deb9b00b9d171b0e","subject":"math","section_id":"math_functions_equations","source_topic_key":"exponential_logarithmic","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"اگر $2^{\\fracrac a3}=k$ باشد، مقدار $\\log_{16}8k^3$ کدام است؟"}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$\\fracrac{3a-6}{8}$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\fracrac{3a+6}{4}$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\fracrac{3a-6}{4}$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\fracrac{3a+6}{8}$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"ابتدا عبارت $\\log_2 k$ را برحسب $a$ به دست می‌آوریم.\n$2^{\\frac{a}{2}} = k \\Rightarrow \\frac{a}{2} = \\log_2 k$\nحال، عبارت $\\log_{16} 8k^3$ را ساده می‌کنیم.\n$\\log_{16} 8k^3 = \\frac{1}{4} \\log_2 8k^3 = \\frac{1}{4} (\\log_2 2^3 + \\log_2 k^3)$\n$= \\frac{1}{4} (3 + \\frac{3a}{2}) = \\frac{6 + 3a}{8}$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":[],"media_evidence":[],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":1498,"question_pdf":"12.pdf","question_page":7,"solution_page":139,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_1499","source_sha256":"c45fe76ed208caaa530982a320b1a197b6189afb4225fe903132f5c30e5ef553","subject":"math","section_id":"math_functions_equations","source_topic_key":"exponential_logarithmic","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"با فرض $\\log_3 9x=\\fracrac53$، مقدار $\\log_9 27x^2$ کدام است؟"}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$\\fracrac23$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\fracrac32$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\fracrac56$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\fracrac76$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"ابتدا مقدار $\\log_3 x$ را به دست می‌آوریم.\n$\\log_3 9x = \\frac{5}{3} \\Rightarrow \\log_3 9 + \\log_3 x = \\frac{5}{3} \\Rightarrow 2 + \\log_3 x = \\frac{5}{3}$\n$\\Rightarrow \\log_3 x = -\\frac{1}{3}$\nحال، $\\log_9 27x^2$ را محاسبه می‌کنیم.\n$\\log_9 27x^2 = \\log_9 27 + \\log_9 x^2 = \\log_{3^2} 3^3 + \\log_{3^2} x^2$\n$= \\frac{3}{2} + \\log_3 x = \\frac{3}{2} - \\frac{1}{3} = \\frac{7}{6}$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":[],"media_evidence":[],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":1499,"question_pdf":"12.pdf","question_page":7,"solution_page":139,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_1500","source_sha256":"512bb05acc0397a7c9b59efa4072d98b1bb0ac8beb7b9b9773167a468d5602f4","subject":"math","section_id":"math_functions_equations","source_topic_key":"exponential_logarithmic","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"اگر $x=9(3\\sqrt3)^{a-1}$ باشد، حاصل $\\log_9 3x^2$ کدام است؟"}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$\\fracrac32a+1$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\fracrac32a-1$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\fracrac{3a+1}{2}$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\fracrac{3a-1}{2}$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"ابتدا $\\log_3 x$ را محاسبه می‌کنیم.\n$x = 9(3\\sqrt{3})^{a-1} = 3^2 (3^{\\frac{3}{2}})^{a-1} = 3^2 \\times 3^{\\frac{3a-3}{2}} = 3^{\\frac{3a+1}{2}}$\n$\\Rightarrow \\log_3 x = \\log_3 3^{\\frac{3a+1}{2}} = \\frac{3a+1}{2}$\nاکنون عبارت $\\log_9 3x^2$ را به دست می‌آوریم.\n$\\log_9 3x^2 = \\frac{1}{2} \\log_3 3x^2 = \\frac{1}{2} (\\log_3 3 + 2\\log_3 x)$\n$= \\frac{1}{2} (1 + (3a+1)) = \\frac{3}{2}a + 1$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":[],"media_evidence":[],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":1500,"question_pdf":"12.pdf","question_page":7,"solution_page":139,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_1501","source_sha256":"37fb55715bb0d7af5fae9c0c445d0f58f603229b5cf52d719470f8c24e804c11","subject":"math","section_id":"math_functions_equations","source_topic_key":"exponential_logarithmic","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"اگر $3^m=12$ و $3^n=54$ باشد، حاصل $(a-2)(b-3)$ کدام است؟"}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$1$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$2$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$3$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$4$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"روش اول: ابتدا عبارات داده‌شده را ساده می‌کنیم:\n$2^a = 12 \\Rightarrow \\frac{2^a}{4} = 3 \\Rightarrow 2^{a-2} = 3$\n$3^b = 54 \\Rightarrow \\frac{3^b}{27} = 2 \\Rightarrow 3^{b-3} = 2$\n$\\Rightarrow (2^{a-2})^{b-3} = 3^{b-3} = 2 \\Rightarrow 2^{(a-2)(b-3)} = 2$\n$\\Rightarrow (a-2)(b-3) = 1$\nروش دوم:\n$a = \\log_2 12 \\quad , \\quad b = \\log_3 54$\n$(a-2)(b-3) = (\\log_2 12 - 2)(\\log_3 54 - 3)$\n$= (\\log_2 12 - \\log_2 4)(\\log_3 54 - \\log_3 27) = \\log_2 3 \\times \\log_3 2 = 1$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":[],"media_evidence":[],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":1501,"question_pdf":"12.pdf","question_page":7,"solution_page":139,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_1502","source_sha256":"24b1b0c839caa0a077eebdae1d32c4ffd01f564737986326545711dc96cb27fe","subject":"math","section_id":"math_functions_equations","source_topic_key":"exponential_logarithmic","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"اگر $\\log_{ab^2}a=-\\fracrac17$ باشد، حاصل $\\log_{a^2b}b$ کدام است؟"}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$2$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$3$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$7$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$8$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"ابتدا معادلة $\\log_{ab^2} a = -\\frac{1}{7}$ را ساده می‌کنیم.\n$\\log_{ab^2} a = -\\frac{1}{7} \\Rightarrow \\log_{a} ab^2 = -7$\n$\\Rightarrow \\log_{a} a + 2 \\log_{a} b = -7 \\Rightarrow 1 + 2 \\log_{a} b = -7$\n$\\Rightarrow \\log_{a} b = -4 \\Rightarrow \\log_{b} a = -\\frac{1}{4}$\nعبارت $\\log_{a^2 b} b$ را $k$ می‌نامیم.\n$k = \\log_{a^2 b} b \\Rightarrow \\frac{1}{k} = \\log_{b} a^2 b = 2 \\log_{b} a + \\log_{b} b$\n$= -\\frac{1}{2} + 1 = \\frac{1}{2} \\Rightarrow k = 2$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":[],"media_evidence":[],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":1502,"question_pdf":"12.pdf","question_page":8,"solution_page":140,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_1503","source_sha256":"77b86036e4dcc106e090b24c3860c8d766217c601f732ac3b7285ce9202a6dad","subject":"math","section_id":"math_functions_equations","source_topic_key":"exponential_logarithmic","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"اگر $\\log_b a=3$ و $\\log_c a=4$ باشد، حاصل $\\log_{bc}a^2$ کدام است؟"}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$\\fracrac7{24}$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\fracrac7{12}$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\fracrac{12}7$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\fracrac{24}7$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"ابتدا لگاریتم $b$ و $c$ را در مبنای $a$ به دست می‌آوریم.\n$\\log_{b} a = 3 \\Rightarrow \\log_{a} b = \\frac{1}{3}$\n$\\log_{c} a = 4 \\Rightarrow \\log_{a} c = \\frac{1}{4}$\nعبارت $\\log_{bc} a^2$ را برابر $k$ قرار می‌دهیم.\n$k = \\log_{bc} a^2 \\Rightarrow \\frac{1}{k} = \\log_{a^2} bc = \\frac{1}{2} \\log_{a} bc$\n$= \\frac{1}{2} (\\log_{a} b + \\log_{a} c) = \\frac{1}{2} (\\frac{1}{3} + \\frac{1}{4}) = \\frac{7}{24} \\Rightarrow k = \\frac{24}{7}$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":[],"media_evidence":[],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":1503,"question_pdf":"12.pdf","question_page":8,"solution_page":140,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_1504","source_sha256":"92c276eaf9ea2b83819eab90054d411d36a4b78a7b5a6ae085538bc833a9967b","subject":"math","section_id":"math_functions_equations","source_topic_key":"exponential_logarithmic","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"هرگاه $\\log_{yz}xy=3$ و $\\log_yxz=4$ باشد، مقدار $\\log_z y$ کدام است؟"}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$2$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$3$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\fracrac12$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\fracrac13$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"هر یک از عبارات داده‌شده را ساده کرده و $x$ را برحسب $y$ و $z$ به دست می‌آوریم.\n$\\left. \\begin{array}{l} \\log_{yz} xy = 3 \\Rightarrow xy = (yz)^3 \\Rightarrow x = y^2 z^3 \\\\ \\log_y xz = 4 \\Rightarrow xz = y^4 \\Rightarrow x = \\frac{y^4}{z} \\end{array} \\right\\}$\n$\\Rightarrow y^2 z^3 = \\frac{y^4}{z} \\Rightarrow y^2 = z^4 \\Rightarrow y = z^2$\nاکنون $\\log_z y$ را محاسبه می‌کنیم.\n$\\log_z y = \\log_z z^2 = 2$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":[],"media_evidence":[],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":1504,"question_pdf":"12.pdf","question_page":8,"solution_page":140,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_1505","source_sha256":"066f165c69269f8d29936e6c2e80daa27b3306cf91461fdf47867c4891811ac4","subject":"math","section_id":"math_functions_equations","source_topic_key":"exponential_logarithmic","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"اگر $3^{\\log a}=b^{\\log3}$ باشد، حاصل $\\log_a b$ کدام است؟"}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$\\log\\fracrac23$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\log\\fracrac32$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\log_2 3$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\log_3 2$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"از دو طرف معادلة $2^{\\log a} = b^{\\log 3}$، لگاریتم می‌گیریم.\n$\\log 2^{\\log a} = \\log b^{\\log 3} \\Rightarrow \\log a \\log 2 = \\log 3 \\log b$\n$\\Rightarrow \\frac{\\log b}{\\log a} = \\frac{\\log 2}{\\log 3} \\Rightarrow \\log_{a} b = \\log_{3} 2$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":[],"media_evidence":[],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":1505,"question_pdf":"12.pdf","question_page":8,"solution_page":140,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_1506","source_sha256":"3bb45583c0cb864c840380bd1e292196d56bc6aa0806684009bd46156b7df93c","subject":"math","section_id":"math_functions_equations","source_topic_key":"exponential_logarithmic","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"اگر $\\fracrac1{\\log_6 3}+\\fracrac1{\\log_k 3}=2$ باشد، مقدار $\\log_{27}2k$ کدام است؟"}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$\\fracrac13$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\fracrac23$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\fracrac32$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$3$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"ابتدا مقدار $k$ را به دست می‌آوریم:\n$\\frac{1}{\\log_{6} 3} + \\frac{1}{\\log_{k} 3} = 2 \\Rightarrow \\log_{3} 6 + \\log_{3} k = 2$\n$\\Rightarrow \\log_{3} 6k = 2 \\Rightarrow 6k = 3^2 = 9 \\Rightarrow k = \\frac{3}{2}$\nحال، مقدار $\\log_{27} 2k$ را محاسبه می‌کنیم.\n$\\log_{27} 2k = \\log_{27} 3 = \\frac{1}{3}$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":[],"media_evidence":[],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":1506,"question_pdf":"12.pdf","question_page":8,"solution_page":140,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_1507","source_sha256":"8436ab49c8fa576c71b7eb2dce387c1c5ae0a3367add1fee7ac0b7f5818aa9ae","subject":"math","section_id":"math_functions_equations","source_topic_key":"exponential_logarithmic","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"ساده‌شده $\\fracrac1{1+\\log_2 12}+\\fracrac1{1+\\log_3 8}+\\fracrac1{1+\\log_4 6}$ کدام است؟"}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$1$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$2$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$3$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$4$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"ابتدا مخرج تمامی کسرها را ساده می‌کنیم.\n$\\frac{1}{1 + \\log_{2} 12} + \\frac{1}{1 + \\log_{3} 8} + \\frac{1}{1 + \\log_{4} 6}$\n$= \\frac{1}{\\log_{2} 2 + \\log_{2} 12} + \\frac{1}{\\log_{3} 3 + \\log_{3} 8} + \\frac{1}{\\log_{4} 4 + \\log_{4} 6}$\n$= \\frac{1}{\\log_{2} 24} + \\frac{1}{\\log_{3} 24} + \\frac{1}{\\log_{4} 24}$\n$= \\log_{24} 2 + \\log_{24} 3 + \\log_{24} 4 = \\log_{24} 24 = 1$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":[],"media_evidence":[],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":1507,"question_pdf":"12.pdf","question_page":8,"solution_page":140,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_1508","source_sha256":"138b98dbed5217e1087b5f5fcbdcab5280455af22372481c5c938e9f1734c8fb","subject":"math","section_id":"math_functions_equations","source_topic_key":"exponential_logarithmic","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"اگر $\\log2=0/3$ باشد، حاصل $10^{0/3}\\timesimes\\log12/8$ چقدر است؟"}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$2/1$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$2/2$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$2/3$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$2/4$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"می‌دانیم $a^{\\log_{a} x} = x$.\n$10^{0/3} \\times \\log 12/8 = 10^{\\log 2} \\times \\log (\\frac{2^7}{10})$\n$= 2 \\times (7 \\log 2 - 1) = 2(7 \\times 0/3 - 1) = 2/2$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":[],"media_evidence":[],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":1508,"question_pdf":"12.pdf","question_page":8,"solution_page":140,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_1509","source_sha256":"b0a99d672b2be53e6fb27c6a3b79b8b864e36714f1d8040395b2f41b8fdc5ee1","subject":"math","section_id":"math_functions_equations","source_topic_key":"exponential_logarithmic","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"مقدار عددی $9^{1+\\log_3 4}$ کدام است؟"}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$11$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$12$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$121$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$144$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"می‌دانیم $a^{\\log_{c} b} = b^{\\log_{c} a}$. بنابراین:\n$9^{1 + \\log_{3} 4} = 9^{\\log_{3} 3 + \\log_{3} 4} = 9^{\\log_{3} 12} = 12^{\\log_{3} 9} = 12^2 = 144$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":[],"media_evidence":[],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":1509,"question_pdf":"12.pdf","question_page":8,"solution_page":140,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_1510","source_sha256":"da16b7a8661908ddf123c0bc907ebe5b3f14de69da2be1aa82d36e08f331bb72","subject":"math","section_id":"math_functions_equations","source_topic_key":"exponential_logarithmic","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"اگر $3^{3-\\log_4(a-1)}=24$، $a$ کدام است؟"}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$\\fracrac89$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\fracrac{10}9$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\fracrac98$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\fracrac9{10}$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"می‌دانیم $k^{\\log_{k} x}$ برابر با $x$ می‌باشد.\n$2^{3 - \\log_{4}(a - 1)} = 24 \\Rightarrow 2^{3 - \\frac{1}{2} \\log_{2}(a - 1)} = 24$\n$\\Rightarrow 2^{3 - \\log_{2}\\sqrt{a - 1}} = 24 \\Rightarrow 2^{\\log_{2} 8 - \\log_{2}\\sqrt{a - 1}} = 24$\n$\\Rightarrow 2^{\\log_{2}\\frac{8}{\\sqrt{a - 1}}} = 24 \\Rightarrow \\frac{8}{\\sqrt{a - 1}} = 24$\n$\\Rightarrow \\sqrt{a - 1} = \\frac{1}{3} \\Rightarrow a - 1 = \\frac{1}{9} \\Rightarrow a = \\frac{10}{9}$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":[],"media_evidence":[],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":1510,"question_pdf":"12.pdf","question_page":8,"solution_page":140,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_1511","source_sha256":"b533d099531ddc18e97069ff26682ef8e3626444c1534a68b2ee53fc06b48d1a","subject":"math","section_id":"math_functions_equations","source_topic_key":"exponential_logarithmic","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"اگر $\\log8=k$، حاصل $\\log(14-6\\sqrt5)+2\\log(3+\\sqrt5)$ کدام است؟"}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$\\fracrac{2k}3$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\fracrac{4k}3$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\fracrac{3k}2$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\fracrac{3k}4$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"می‌دانیم $\\log 8 = k$ است. بنابراین:\n$3 \\log 2 = k \\Rightarrow \\log 2 = \\frac{k}{3}$\nاکنون عبارت خواسته‌شده را ساده می‌کنیم:\n$\\log(14 - 6\\sqrt{5}) + 2 \\log(3 + \\sqrt{5})$\n$= \\log(3 - \\sqrt{5})^2 + 2 \\log(3 + \\sqrt{5})$\n$= 2 \\log(3 - \\sqrt{5}) + 2 \\log(3 + \\sqrt{5})$\n$= 2 (\\log(3 - \\sqrt{5}) + \\log(3 + \\sqrt{5}))$\n$= 2 \\log(3 - \\sqrt{5})(3 + \\sqrt{5}) = 2 \\log 4 = 4 \\log 2 = \\frac{4k}{3}$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":[],"media_evidence":[],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":1511,"question_pdf":"12.pdf","question_page":8,"solution_page":140,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_1512","source_sha256":"054f9a75400194081c11c7f52ac9084d5268b9a6e13e47547878bce2f4f27cd5","subject":"math","section_id":"math_functions_equations","source_topic_key":"exponential_logarithmic","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"اگر $\\log_{15}3=k$ باشد، مقدار $\\log_5 15$ بر حسب $k$ کدام است؟"}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$k-1$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\fracrac1{k-1}$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$1-k$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\fracrac1{1-k}$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"$\\log_{5} 15$ را ساده می‌کنیم:\n$\\log_{5} 15 = \\frac{1}{\\log_{15} 5} = \\frac{1}{\\log_{15}\\frac{15}{3}} = \\frac{1}{\\log_{15} 15 - \\log_{15} 3}$\n$= \\frac{1}{1 - \\log_{15} 3} = \\frac{1}{1 - k}$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":[],"media_evidence":[],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":1512,"question_pdf":"12.pdf","question_page":8,"solution_page":140,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_1513","source_sha256":"b09460416f8aa9f09884b3957ebda1c71b860080f3afa9c2184df189d30dc21b","subject":"math","section_id":"math_functions_equations","source_topic_key":"exponential_logarithmic","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"اگر $\\log3=a$ و $\\log225=b$ باشد، مقدار $\\log2$ بر حسب $a$ و $b$ کدام است؟"}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$a+\\fracrac b2-1$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$2a-b+1$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$2a+b-1$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$a-\\fracrac b2+1$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"عبارت $b = \\log 225$ را ساده می‌کنیم.\n$b = \\log 225 = \\log 15^2 = 2 \\log 15 = 2(\\log 3 + \\log 5)$\n$= 2(a + \\log 5) = 2(a + 1 - \\log 2) \\Rightarrow a + 1 - \\log 2 = \\frac{b}{2}$\n$\\Rightarrow \\log 2 = a + 1 - \\frac{b}{2}$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":[],"media_evidence":[],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":1513,"question_pdf":"12.pdf","question_page":8,"solution_page":140,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_1514","source_sha256":"c9f77e9b7727049212f49786ea613ad8eee7367166fe3e8a0ca72e34edf8c4c8","subject":"math","section_id":"math_functions_equations","source_topic_key":"exponential_logarithmic","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"هرگاه $\\log_2 3=k$، حاصل $\\log_{36}48$ کدام است؟"}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$\\fracrac{k+4}{2k+4}$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\fracrac{k+2}{2k+4}$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\fracrac{k+4}{2k+2}$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\fracrac{k+2}{2k+2}$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"چون $k$ به شکل لگاریتم در مبنای $2$ می‌باشد، عبارت $\\log_{36} 48$ را به صورت $\\frac{\\log_{2} 48}{\\log_{2} 36}$ می‌نویسیم.\n$\\log_{36} 48 = \\frac{\\log_{2} 48}{\\log_{2} 36} = \\frac{\\log_{2} 16 + \\log_{2} 3}{\\log_{2} 4 + \\log_{2} 9} = \\frac{4 + k}{2 + 2k}$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":[],"media_evidence":[],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":1514,"question_pdf":"12.pdf","question_page":8,"solution_page":140,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_1515","source_sha256":"b612f0d4c48774b6a5edd86f8a866b0ac8dc2b5d5713c2cb88191420e159658c","subject":"math","section_id":"math_functions_equations","source_topic_key":"exponential_logarithmic","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"اگر $\\log75=a$ و $\\log45=b$ باشد، حاصل $\\log12$ کدام است؟"}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$\\fracrac{4b-5a-6}{3}$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\fracrac{4b-5a+6}{3}$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\fracrac{4a-5b-6}{3}$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\fracrac{4a-5b+6}{3}$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"ابتدا عبارات $a$ و $b$ را ساده می‌کنیم:\n$\\left. \\begin{array}{l} a = \\log 75 = \\log 3 + \\log 25 = \\log 3 + 2 \\log 5 \\\\ b = \\log 45 = \\log 9 + \\log 5 = 2 \\log 3 + \\log 5 \\end{array} \\right\\} \\times -2$\n$\\Rightarrow -3 \\log 3 = a - 2b \\Rightarrow \\log 3 = \\frac{2b - a}{3}$\n$\\Rightarrow b = 2(\\frac{2b - a}{3}) + \\log 5 \\Rightarrow \\log 5 = \\frac{2a - b}{3}$\nاکنون $\\log 12$ را محاسبه می‌کنیم.\n$\\log 12 = \\log 4 + \\log 3 = 2 \\log 2 + \\log 3 = 2 - 2 \\log 5 + \\log 3$\n$= 2 - \\frac{4a - 2b}{3} + \\frac{2b - a}{3} = \\frac{4b - 5a + 6}{3}$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":[],"media_evidence":[],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":1515,"question_pdf":"12.pdf","question_page":8,"solution_page":140,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_1516","source_sha256":"e6c402d7cc6465589d7a0f59988f7097375cb351591dbccb3d01f9114fdfbf23","subject":"math","section_id":"math_functions_equations","source_topic_key":"exponential_logarithmic","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"اگر $\\log_2 216+\\log_3 216=k(\\log_2 216)(\\log_3 216)$ باشد، $k$ کدام است؟"}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$2$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\fracrac12$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$3$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\fracrac13$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"در دو طرف معادله $\\log_{۱۶}(۳)\\log_{۳}(۱۶)$ را ضرب می‌کنیم.\n$(\\log_{۲۱۶} ۲) (\\log_{۲۱۶} ۳) (\\log_{۲} ۲۱۶ + \\log_{۳} ۲۱۶) \\\\ = \\text{k}(\\log_{۲} ۲۱۶)(\\log_{۳} ۲۱۶)(\\log_{۲۱۶} ۲)(\\log_{۲۱۶} ۳) \\\\ \\Rightarrow \\log_{۲۱۶} ۳ + \\log_{۲۱۶} ۲ = \\text{k} \\Rightarrow \\text{k} = \\log_{۲۱۶} ۶ = \\log_{۶^۳} ۶ \\\\ \\Rightarrow \\text{k} = \\frac{۱}{۳}$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":[],"media_evidence":[],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":1516,"question_pdf":"12.pdf","question_page":8,"solution_page":141,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true}]}
